#: f176056125be45f28ff26a3a730e4aca
msgid ""
"If the receiver is FPort the receiver must be tied to the USART6 TX pin , "
"RSSI_TYPE set to 3, and SERIAL6_OPTIONS must be set to 7 (invert TX/RX, half"
" duplex)."
msgstr ""
"如果接收机是 FPort，则接收机必须连接到 USART6 TX 引脚，RSSI_TYPE 设为 3，且 SERIAL6_OPTIONS 必须设为 "
"7（反相 TX/RX，半双工）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-X3.rst:171
#: 02269b32bd2f49c6937a3f0b05bd6cc9 306f8d1a0fdd4770a8535bf22d3fb597
