msgid ""
"For full duplex like CRSF/ELRS use both RX6 and TX6 and set "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` also to 3."
msgstr ""
"对于 CRSF/ELRS 等全双工协议，同时使用 RX6 和 TX6，并将 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` 同样设为 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-X3.rst:172
