"The NarinFC-X3 supports up to 13 PWM outputs. Outputs 1-10 support DShot and"
" Bi-Directional DShot. The pads for motor output M1 to M4 are provided on "
"both the motor connectors and on separate pads, plus M9-13 on a separate "
"pads for LED strip and other PWM outputs."
